<title>THAILAND: Thai Military wins agency bond auctions.</title>
<headline>Thai Military wins agency bond auctions.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Military Bank Plc said on Friday a consortium it leads won auctions in two state agency bonds worth a combined 4.5 billion baht.</p>
</text>
